{"id":"f7485367dddfad10a11fd8db969195fc0f215e4eb5deae13463e45adb74d3b0f","pubkey":"79416b7f67ac988f40550c518d6676db6d6f54d2d98e4519eec854b87bd79913","created_at":1782604966,"content":"A one-of-a-kind stained glass installation laying two windows on top of one another\n\nThe homeowner loved the design of the original window but felt the colours weren’t complementing the home well. They didn’t want to remove the window either, so we came to the idea of stacking the windows. They were an artist themselves, so they appreciated the contemporary approach\n\nThe final result is a beautiful layered window that creates a 3 dimensional effect, adding some serious depth and movement to the window \n\n#gn #grownostr #art #business #architecture\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/0fb01fa7e12cb477b8fc3ee65c95bf302f3d29730e4053593139025d522b8fd1.jpg\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/6b35c16f590933b039f0a54a15c4b9ae55f8973912388e90b6da06c893c45987.mov\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/925b5c4023c42a6acd41e85ce45436608b6611d871acfbc53d1b48ac2744e31d.jpg","tags":[["t","gn"],["t","grownostr"],["t","art"],["t","business"],["t","architecture"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/0fb01fa7e12cb477b8fc3ee65c95bf302f3d29730e4053593139025d522b8fd1.jpg","m jpeg","dim 3024.0x4032.0"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/6b35c16f590933b039f0a54a15c4b9ae55f8973912388e90b6da06c893c45987.mov","m video/quicktime","dim 1080.0x1920.0"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/925b5c4023c42a6acd41e85ce45436608b6611d871acfbc53d1b48ac2744e31d.jpg","m jpeg","dim 4032.0x3024.0"]]}
