{"id":"00005fa39113c39f2732a38cbaabf10a9c9b26d704c2281d3f3fd0ec6db592d8","pubkey":"45f195cffcb8c9724efc248f0507a2fb65b579dfabe7cd35398598163cab7627","created_at":1782589505,"content":"https://blossom.primal.net/760f2472d7b6c87bf2e35aa8a8ada0e043573f2ebbd273269da8a88d80798ff6.mp4","tags":[["nonce","20730","16"]]}
{"id":"c1e62bf6859358e0b30b33d8e62562520b6d79b2d6a3381e3979d00bb2f46e8c","pubkey":"acbcec475a1a4f9481939ecfbd1c3d111f5b5a474a39ae039bbc720fdd305bec","created_at":1782588903,"content":"\"You can just imagine how much that farm village lifestyle was so beneficial to the human being. To have family and friends all dependent and co-dependent on each other in a good way. In a setting that was in one with nature and you just got to breathe that life and that land gave back to you and what you gave it it gave back and that reciprocity was there. Fast forward to 2020 and we're kind of in these condos and apartments, single family dwellings with no yards and the food just comes to a store.\n\nSo that disconnect is not our fault or anything but it is our responsibility and our kuleana to get back to understanding human life was in that grand web with everything else not apart from it. 💚\n\nAnd that's is the essential teachings of KNF and natural farming is to merge back in with that system. Because that system is abundance, that's the mentality. And that's the big disconnect I see with conventional or the western mindset versus natural or KNF farming is abundance mentality versus scarcity mentality.\"\n\nLoving it! [00:57:25]\n\nhttps://youtu.be/Jd5G15ZX1k4?t=3445","tags":[]}
{"id":"692f6822c117539afe2e03da45e7059447038171adf22fa2b60ff15e70201601","pubkey":"01d0bbf9537ef1fd0ddf815f41c1896738f6a3a0f600f51c782b7d8891130d4c","created_at":1782588454,"content":"Why on earth some people insist on applying chemical fertilizers that destroy the soil when you can grow beautiful green mulch that looks like this. The bees absolutely love it. Adds organic matter to the soil, fixes nitrogen, and provides habitat for beneficial insects as well. Healthy soil is living soil. #permaculture #farmstr\nhttps://npub1q8gth72n0mcl6rwls905rsvfvuu0dgaq7cq028rc9d7c3ygnp4xq84awvk.blossom.band/c02dd0c73acef0336c2e1c9d7a39f8668cd6e8070a056268539bc6b3d28bcd2c.jpg\nhttps://npub1q8gth72n0mcl6rwls905rsvfvuu0dgaq7cq028rc9d7c3ygnp4xq84awvk.blossom.band/511b48a33ff9c85f30937f39548f32f2d602ca3bc7049fe54a14a28c158279bd.mp4","tags":[["t","permaculture"],["t","farmstr"],["imeta","url https://npub1q8gth72n0mcl6rwls905rsvfvuu0dgaq7cq028rc9d7c3ygnp4xq84awvk.blossom.band/c02dd0c73acef0336c2e1c9d7a39f8668cd6e8070a056268539bc6b3d28bcd2c.jpg","m jpeg","dim 3024.0x4032.0"],["imeta","url https://npub1q8gth72n0mcl6rwls905rsvfvuu0dgaq7cq028rc9d7c3ygnp4xq84awvk.blossom.band/511b48a33ff9c85f30937f39548f32f2d602ca3bc7049fe54a14a28c158279bd.mp4","m video/quicktime","dim 1080.0x1920.0"]]}
